flowchart TD
    SRC["refined source<br/>94 HWP + 4 PDF"]:::gray --> BASE["canonical text/table identities<br/>unchanged"]:::green
    BASE --> HHELP["pinned rhwp JS/WASM helper<br/>exact key + full body/cell anchor"]:::green
    BASE --> PDF["durable PDF v2 runner<br/>4 docs / 570 pages"]:::green
    HHELP --> HSVG["SVG data-URI overlay<br/>viewBox + rect clip + linear effect"]:::green
    HSVG --> HREP["5 HWP representative run<br/>27 objects<br/>15 eligible / 1 quarantined / 11 withheld"]:::amber
    HSVG --> HTIFF["TIFF/GIF/WMF/SVG<br/>source provenance only"]:::red
    PDF --> POCC["416 resources / 1,110 occurrences<br/>1,103 eligible / 7 ambiguous"]:::green
    HREP --> OCC["VisualOccurrenceV2<br/>page + bbox + nonblank crop hash"]:::green
    POCC --> OCC
    OCC --> OCRRUN["PP-StructureV3 / Korean PP-OCRv5 adapter<br/>pinned OS network sandbox"]:::green
    OCRRUN --> MODEL{"private pinned model<br/>weights available?"}:::gray
    MODEL -->|"no"| OBLK["actual OCR/caption run withheld<br/>external calls 0"]:::red
    MODEL -. "yes after pin/review" .-> EVID["OCR/layout + supported caption evidence"]:::amber
    EVID --> VCHUNK["visual chunks<br/>evidence prefix + answer-support contract"]:::green
    VCHUNK --> RET["bounded visual quota + RRF<br/>caption cap / OCR priority"]:::green
    RET --> CITE["page/bbox/crop visual citation<br/>evaluation parity"]:::green
    CITE --> GOLD{"reviewed 5 HWP + 4 PDF gold?"}:::gray
    GOLD -->|"no"| FULL["94-HWP corpus mode fail-closed"]:::red
    GOLD -. "yes" .-> ROLL["94-HWP resumable rollout"]:::amber
    SRC -. "external parser/search API forbidden" .-> OBLK

